# Keep the build context small and prevent host artifacts from leaking into
# the image. Anything the image needs must be explicitly un-ignored below.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes

bin/
dist/
tmp/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
cover.out
coverage.html

# Never let a developer's real secrets into a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
*.mmdb

test/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# The render-verification harness (tools/render-verify, Plan.md D25). Named in
# full rather than left to `node_modules/` above: these patterns are matched
# against the whole path with Go's filepath.Match, where `*` does not cross a
# `/`, so `node_modules/` excludes the one at the root and nothing nested. The
# builder stage runs `COPY . .`, so without this line 19MB of Playwright would
# be shipped into the build context and into a layer of an image that has no
# Node in it. Nothing here is compiled: `go list ./...` finds no package under
# tools/.
tools/

docker-compose*.yml
Caddyfile
Taskfile.yml

.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
